# ==============================================================================
# .gitignore — tree-methanogens
# ==============================================================================
# Strategy: track code and the directory structure. Data are archived on Zenodo and
# outputs are regenerated by the pipeline; for both, only .gitkeep files are tracked
# so the directory layout (and every path) is pre-wired.
# ==============================================================================

# --- R project files ---
.Rproj.user
.Rhistory
.RData
.Ruserdata
*.Rproj

# --- macOS ---
.DS_Store

# --- Claude Code ---
.claude/

# --- Manuscript files (not for public repos) ---
manuscript/
*.docx
*.tex
REVISED_*.md
REFERENCE_*.md
supporting_information.md
references.bib
doi_list.txt
outputs/figure_captions.md
# Revision prose/notes (manuscript-adjacent; not for public repo)
code/revision/notes/
# notes now live in manuscript/notes (private repo); this path is a symlink to them
code/revision/notes

# --- Data (all archived on Zenodo; git tracks ONLY the folder structure) ---
# Every data file lives in the Zenodo archive and drops into data/ locally.
# Git keeps only .gitkeep so the directory layout (and all paths) are pre-wired.
data/**
!data/**/
!data/**/.gitkeep

# --- Outputs (regenerable via the pipeline; git tracks ONLY the folder structure
#     and the assembled numbered manuscript figure set) ---
outputs/**
!outputs/**/
!outputs/**/.gitkeep
# Nothing under outputs/ is tracked -- only the folder skeleton, as for data/.
# code/make_figures.R regenerates the numbered figure set from the data.
#
# NOTE for submission: figures therefore live only on disk after a local run.
# The Zenodo archive holds data/, not outputs/, so journal figure files come from
# outputs/figures/{main,SI}/ after running make_figures.R -- not from the repo.

# --- Deprecated directory (old code/data, not tracked) ---
deprecated/

# --- Temporary/auto-generated files ---
Rplots.pdf
*.Rplots.pdf

# goFlux import intermediates (written only when windows are re-picked)
RData/

# --- Local-only files that must never be committed ---
CLAUDE.md
CLAUDE.local.md
AGENTS.md
.Renviron
/notes/
code/**/*.pdf
code/**/*.rds
code/**/*.RData
code/**/*.rda
